   For some reason, mailers both here and abroad have bounced messages
back and forth regarding the procedure for getting PC-HACK binaries and
sources.  If you would like to get PC-HACK, send three floppy disks and
a self-addressed, stamped envelope with 75 cents postage to me at the
address given below.  You will recieve, in return, the latest version of
PC-HACK, the PC-HACK sources (which are also the sources for HACK 1.0.3
for UN*X systems), and a copy of the ARC utility used to unpack 'em.

   The latest version has several improvements, including the ability to
run on most MS-DOS machines, specifically including the DEC Rainbow. Many
thanks go to Don Kneller for making HACK available for MS-DOS!

